cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RepairFuzz in academic work, please cite the ISSTA 2026 paper."
title: "RepairFuzz: repair-driven greybox fuzzing"
abstract: >-
  RepairFuzz is a greybox fuzzer built on AFL++ that combines byte-level input
  mutation with grammar-based input repair using the CPCT+ error-recovery
  algorithm.
